iWasserman2014: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed\nAitchison1982: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed\nEgozcue2003: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied; direct publisher abstract/description consulted\nAitchisonShen1980: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied\nKoenkerBassett1978: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied\nKoenkerHallock2001: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed\nFriedman2001: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed\nFriedman2002: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied\nEfron1979: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed\nWilson1927: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied\nHoerlKennard1970: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied\nStone1974: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed\nHastie2009: Crossref title, author, venue and abstract fields only; no citation networks accessed; direct DOI OpenAlex abstract, where supplied\nAngelopoulosBates2021: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nRomano2019: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nTibshirani2019: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nBarber2021: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nBarberLimits2021: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nGuan2023: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nVovk2012: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nBarberBeyond2023: Direct known arXiv identifier; read title, authors and abstract only; no references or related-page links accessed\nMeinshausen2006: Article landing-page abstract\nGrounding scopes: ['', 'Frozen final observations or directly consulted references.', 'Implementation/protocol facts require the listed readable source files; the episode ID links the evaluation context, not every code detail.']\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
